<p>Before you continue</p>
<p>Think of something you are completely confident will happen tomorrow — the sun rising, your phone turning on, water flowing from the tap. Now ask: <em>why</em> are you confident? What is the actual basis of that confidence? Hold that question in mind as you read. Hume’s answer will probably surprise you.</p>
</div></div>
